  "claim": "An illustrator has worked on the 2004 superhero film directed by Brad Bird. Some volumes of a collection of writings was illustrated by the same artist. Tales for the Midnight Hour was a precursor for this collection of writings.",
  "evidencia": "Page: Ricardo Delgado (comics). Sentence: Ricardo Delgado is a film and comic book artist who has worked on such films as \"The Incredibles\", \"Men in Black\" and \"Apollo 13\".\nPage: The Incredibles. Sentence: The Incredibles is a 2004 American computer-animated superhero film written and directed by Brad Bird, produced by Pixar Animation Studios, and released by Walt Disney Pictures.\nPage: Scary Stories for Sleep-overs. Sentence: Scary Stories for Sleep-overs is a series of scary children's books written by R.C. Welch, Q.L. Pearce, and various other authors and illustrated by Ricardo Delgado, Bartt Warbuton, Dwight Been and others throughout the series.\nPage: Tales for the Midnight Hour. Sentence: This anthology horror series served as the precursor to various other similar works, including \"Scary Stories to Tell in the Dark\" and \"Scary Stories for Sleep-overs\".",
