        "id": 0,
        "original_id": "2aff1962-f25f-5580-97aa-1c03a97c8b48",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Ricardo Delgado, Brad Bird, R.C. Welch, Q.L. Pearce, Bartt Warbuton, Dwight Been\n- Films: The Incredibles, Men in Black, Apollo 13\n- Books/Series: Scary Stories for Sleep-overs, Tales for the Midnight Hour, Scary Stories to Tell in the Dark\n- Companies: Pixar Animation Studios, Walt Disney Pictures\n\nFacts:\n- Ricardo Delgado is a film and comic book artist.\n- Ricardo Delgado has worked on the films Apollo 13, Men in Black, and The Incredibles.\n- The Incredibles is a 2004 American computer-animated superhero film.\n- Brad Bird wrote and directed The Incredibles.\n- Pixar Animation Studios produced The Incredibles, and Walt Disney Pictures released it.\n- Scary Stories for Sleep-overs is a series of scary children's books.\n- R.C. Welch, Q.L. Pearce, and various other authors wrote Scary Stories for Sleep-overs.\n- Ricardo Delgado, Bartt Warbuton, Dwight Been, and others illustrated Scary Stories for Sleep-overs throughout the series.\n- Tales for the Midnight Hour is an anthology horror series.\n- Tales for the Midnight Hour served as a precursor to Scary Stories to Tell in the Dark and Scary Stories for Sleep-overs.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
      {
        "id": 1,
